{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Celebrity-Chef-Warrior-Mom Expansion\u00a0</strong>adds <strong>over 120 items, skills, encounters</strong>, and a new playable hero to The Bazaar: Jules! Each expansion brings an entirely new experience to The Bazaar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082620/extras/9756d22761221ae8ff67f9b48372221a.poster.avif?t=1761147767\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082620/extras/9756d22761221ae8ff67f9b48372221a.webm?t=1761147767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082620/extras/9756d22761221ae8ff67f9b48372221a.mp4?t=1761147767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cuisine queen has arrived! While other heroes clash and struggle, Jules brings cozy warmth to the Bazaar as a tough  mom running a restaurant in the wildest food scene in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why fight when you can feast? Expand Jules\u2019 kitchen with heating and cooling elements that unlock mouthwatering effects on your cards. Not even the vilest monster can resist her cooking!<i> </i> <br>  <br>Come to The Bazaar hungry and leave Jules' Cafe full with the <strong>Celebrity-Chef-Warrior-Mom Expansion!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082620?t=1761147767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082620/9e4d5e87f245a7afdf37c2e6b5f20bd096b3c859/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761147767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082620/71ce9afc7042cccf0be4446e4821dcb4247ba9d1/